    "description": "<b>Spider Solitaire</b> is a classic, popular and amazing solitaire card game in the world! You will be addicted if you play this Spider Solitaire card games. \r\n\r\n<b>Why we designed this game for seniors?</b>\r\nAt present, most elderly people lack companionship, interesting and memory decline. We choose this classic spider card game that is a favorite among seniors. It not only kills time, but also trains your brain and brings endless fun.\r\n\r\n<b>The main idea of this Spider Solitaire card game is pure classic card game.</b>\r\nThere is no complicated coin system and no irrelevant treasure chest rewards. No need to watch ads, you can directly use all the themes and amazing backgrounds in this spider solitaire card game. You can play the game anytime, anywhere, no WiFi required. It's just a pure classic spider card game. Don\u2019t worry, it\u2019s still a free spider card games.\r\n\r\n<b>If you play this classic card game, you won't be able to put it down. Why?</b>\r\n\u2022 Classic gameplay, but with redundant functions removed for the elderly. You will easily get started and be addicted to it.\r\n\u2022 Smooth operation: When you are addicted to card games, you will not feel any lag or discomfort.\r\n\u2022 Specifically designed for seniors: Bigger cards, larger fonts and an eye-friendly interface design make it easier for you to enjoy this classic card game without worrying about eye fatigue.\r\n\u2022 Dozens of stunning themes: Whether you prefer a classic solid color background, a background with pets or a background theme enjoying nature. In this free classic card game, you can use them anytime, anywhere without watching ads or spending coins.\r\n\r\n<b>What benefits will you get from playing this game?</b>\r\n\u2022 Train your brain: Weave your way as a beginner through 1 and 2 suit games and move up in difficulty to become a true Spider Solitaire master! At the same time, your mind becomes sharper by you strategize, solve problems, and think logically.\r\n\u2022 Enhance Your Memory: You need to focus your attention and remember the moving position of the cards to solve spider card game. Naturally, your memory will also be enhanced.\r\n\u2022 No feeling lonely or bored: Playing spider card games can kill the time and allow you to relax and enjoy life. You can choose pet themes for free and accompany you to beat the deal.\r\n\r\n<b>How to Play?</b>\r\nPlaying Spider Solitaire is both easy and fun! In Spider game, the goal is to remove all the cards from the table by creating \"runs\" of cards. Each run needs to be organized in descending order from King to Ace. You can play 1 Suit at the beginning, and if you want to challenge yourself or try your luck, you can play 2 Suit ,3Suit and 4 Suit. Keep playing for a month and you will become a Spider Solitaire expert!\r\n\r\n<b>Classic Spider Features:</b>\r\n\u2022 Daily Challenges: When you do daily challenges for a month, you will get a gold trophy.\r\n\u2022 Custom Card Suits: Spider Solitaire games come in 1, 2, 3 & 4 suit varieties.\r\n\u2022 Track your Spider games statistics.\r\n\u2022 Unlimited Undoes and Hints.\r\n\u2022 Custom pictures for card backs and backgrounds.\r\n\u2022 Right hand or left hand to play\r\n\u2022 Tap to move for quick gameplay\r\n\u2022 No Wi-Fi Required.\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t miss out on this <b>FREE</b> Spider Solitaire card game! Download and got it for your mobile device <b>Now</b>!",
